# efx configuration schema
#
# One key per line:
#   NAME|TYPE|DEFAULT|GROUP|DESCRIPTION
#
# TYPE is one of:
#   str          free-form string
#   int          integer
#   bool         yes|no
#   dir          directory that must exist
#   file         file that must exist
#   outdir       directory that will be created if missing
#   enum:a,b,c   one of the listed values
#
# GROUP selects which GUI page shows the key.
# Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.

# ---- general -------------------------------------------------------------
EFX_PROJECT_DIR|dir||general|Efinity FPGA project directory (contains the .xml project file)
SOC_VARIANT|enum:hard,fcu|hard|general|Which SoC runs Linux: hard = efx_hard_soc, fcu = EfxSapphireFCU
BOARD|str|ti375c529|general|br2-efinix board name (must exist in the dt-generator devkit list)
ARCH|enum:32,64|32|general|RISC-V machine architecture passed to init.sh -m
WORKSPACE|str|build_ti375_oob|general|Workspace directory name, created next to the repo
JOBS|int||general|Parallel make jobs (empty = nproc)

# ---- device tree / SoC map ----------------------------------------------
SOCMAP_OVERLAY|str|socmap/ti375_oob_hard.h|general|Project-specific soc.h overlay, relative to tools/efx (empty = none)
DT_FEATURES|str||general|Extra device-tree features beyond the ones auto-detected from soc.h (sdhc,ethernet,dma,fb,usb,emmc). Needs matching overrides in dtoverlay/ and RTL that actually wires the peripheral to this SoC.

# ---- rootfs --------------------------------------------------------------
ROOTFS_MODE|enum:initramfs,spinor,emmc,sdcard|initramfs|image|initramfs = rootfs embedded in the kernel; spinor = squashfs on the second SPI flash, written from a running system; emmc = read-write ext4 on the on-board eMMC, written from a running system; sdcard = genimage sdcard.img
ROOTFS_MTDBLOCK|str|8|image|Which mtdblock carries the spinor rootfs, counted in the order the device tree declares the partitions
EMMC_ROOT_DEV|str|/dev/mmcblk1p1|image|emmc rootfs: the partition the kernel mounts as root (the 1 GiB rootfs.ext4 goes there)
EMMC_DATA_DEV|str|/dev/mmcblk1p2|image|emmc rootfs: the partition mounted at /data, which also holds the FCU firmware (/data/fcufw)
ROOTFS_PACKAGES|enum:minimal,full|minimal|image|minimal = busybox rootfs; full = also configs/extra_packages_fragment (perl, python, vim, benchmarks)
PROJECT_SW|str|npu fcu|image|Project software in the image: npu = StalyaNPU driver, libsnpu, snpu-bench (ip/stalyanpu/sw); fcu = FCU remoteproc driver and test firmware (sw/); px4 = the PX4 firmware named by PX4_ELF. Empty = none
PX4_ELF|file||image|PX4 firmware for the FCU, built out of tree (px4-core, make stalya_nexus-v2_default). Needed by PROJECT_SW=px4
NET_ADDRESS|str||image|Address eth0 comes up with, e.g. 192.168.50.2/24. Empty = the interface is left down
DDS_AGENT|enum:y,n|n|image|Build Fast DDS and the Micro XRCE-DDS agent into the image, and run the agent on the FCU's rpmsg tty
DDS_AGENT_DEV|str|/dev/ttyRPMSG0|image|Device the agent listens on (the rpmsg tty the FCU's DDS client writes to)

# ---- FSBL ----------------------------------------------------------------
FSBL_HOST|enum:hard,fcu|hard|fsbl|Which SoC BSP the first-stage bootloader is built for
RISCV_BIN_DIR|dir|/media/tmk/uniwork/tools/riscv/xpack-riscv-none-elf-gcc/bin|fsbl|Bare-metal RISC-V toolchain bin directory
RISCV_PREFIX|str|riscv-none-elf-|fsbl|Toolchain tool prefix (BSP default is riscv-none-embed-)
EFX_FSBL_CFLAGS_EXTRA|str||fsbl|Extra CFLAGS appended to the FSBL build (escape hatch)
FSBL_CONFIG|str|fsbl/bootloaderConfig.h|fsbl|bootloaderConfig.h to build in, relative to tools/efx (empty = boards/efinix/common/bootloaderConfig.h)
FCU_FIRMWARE|str|sw/fcu_test/build/fcu_test.bin|fpga|FCU on-chip RAM image for efx fpga bram-update, relative to the Efinity project

# ---- FPGA / Efinity ------------------------------------------------------
EFINITY_HOME|dir|/media/tmk/uniwork/tools/efx/efinity/2026.1|fpga|Linux Efinity installation root
FPGA_DEVICE|str|Ti375C529|fpga|Target FPGA device
FPGA_PROJECT|str|ti375_oob|fpga|Efinity project name (without .xml)

# ---- buildroot tuning ----------------------------------------------------
EFX_DL_DIR|str||general|Buildroot download cache (empty = Buildroot default, under $HOME)
EFX_CCACHE_DIR|str||general|Buildroot ccache directory (empty = Buildroot default, under $HOME)

# ---- flash ---------------------------------------------------------------
FLASH_OPENSBI_OFFSET|str|0x00600000|flash|SPI flash offset for fw_jump.bin
FLASH_UBOOT_OFFSET|str|0x00680000|flash|SPI flash offset for u-boot.bin
FLASH_BITSTREAM_OFFSET|str|0x00000000|flash|SPI flash offset for the FPGA bitstream
FLASH_DTB_OFFSET|str|0x00740000|flash|SPI flash offset for linux.dtb
FLASH_BOOTSCR_OFFSET|str|0x00750000|flash|SPI flash offset for the U-Boot boot script (must match CONFIG_BOOTCOMMAND)
FLASH_KERNEL_OFFSET|str|0x00800000|flash|SPI flash offset for the kernel Image (with initramfs)
